#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-ons manager
#: addon\buildVars.py:26 buildVars.py:26
msgid ""
"A flexible  add-on that allows NVDA to announces the type and state of the  "
"GUI controls before their label. The names  of types and states can also be "
"customized. The add-on supports checkboxes, radio buttons and checkable menu "
"items.\n"
"More info on :\n"
"https://www.rptools.org/access/?p=controltypebeforelabel"
msgstr ""

